> Theorem J for six and for eight elements; Lemmas X, Y, A; Proposition K; Corollary K) and every theorem and lemma
> stands as far as it read; it recomputed Lemma ρ: for six elements by all signings from the definition, on every
> multiset of Z_4 to Z_32; for eight elements by a recursion of its own over all trees, which it compared with all
